<title>USA: Home Properties to sell $35 mln stake.</title>
<headline>Home Properties to sell $35 mln stake.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Properties of New York Inc said on Tuesday that it has entered into an agreement to sell a $35 million Class A Limited Partnership Interest in Home Properties of New York LP to the State of Michigan Retirement Systems.</p>
<p>The Class A Limited Partnership Interest can be converted into 1,666,667 shares of common stock in the company, which equates to an effective conversion price of $21.00 per share.</p>
<p>Resale of converted shares will be restricted for the next 24 months.</p>
</text>
